<title>SWEDEN: Avesta Sheffield raises stainless prices.</title>
<headline>Avesta Sheffield raises stainless prices.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-Swedish steelmaker Avesta Sheffield said on Tuesday it had increased prices of stainless steel by between five and 11 percent to take effect on November 1.</p>
</text>
